" velocity as the default note, which o adds; and , T a turns gridadvance on and off. :grid
" and :len set them by length, such as 1/8 or 1/16t.
keysection "The grid and default note"
nmap zh         grid-finer                "Finer grid"
nmap z<Left>    grid-finer                "Finer grid"
nmap zl         grid-coarser              "Coarser grid"
