" Alt-L a nudge (the nudge setting, in milliseconds), Alt-{ and Alt-} a bar, Alt-k and Alt-j
" a semitone, Alt-K and Alt-J an octave, or Alt and Alt-Shift with the arrow keys. = and -
" move its end to the grid steps either side, + and _ a nudge.
