" Playing: Space plays from the play-from marker (the ▶ in the margin), or stops where it is,
" the cursor landing there; Shift-Space stops and goes back to where the cursor was when it
" started. m Space puts the marker at the cursor, and Ctrl-Space puts it there and plays.
" With rewind (on by default) the marker stays put, so Space plays the same again; without,
